        "@type": "BusinessAudience",
        "audienceType": "Invisible Elite (Estate Level Service Providers)",
        "description": "The Invisible Elite, also called Estate Level Service Providers, are owner-led, premium-tier businesses and professionals who serve high-net-worth and ultra-high-net-worth clients with high-craft services tied to the estate, home, property and lifestyle: luxury real estate, custom pools, landscape and outdoor estate design, smart home integration, luxury automotive advisory and related trades. They typically earn $1M to $15M+ in annual revenue, win clients through reputation and referral, and are often missing or misdescribed in AI-generated answers. The term was coined by MT Media AI (Modern Touch Media).",
